---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Medical Disclaimer"
  description="Ethereal provides general educational estimates, not medical advice. Read who should not rely on the calculators and when to see a professional."
  path="/disclaimer/"
>
  <div class="container-page pt-12 pb-16 sm:pt-16">
    <article class="prose-ethereal max-w-3xl">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">Medical disclaimer</h1>
      <p>
        The calculators, articles and other content on Ethereal are provided for general educational
        purposes only. They are estimates based on population equations and are not medical,
        nutritional or fitness advice, and they do not create a practitioner–patient relationship.
      </p>
      <h2>Please consult a professional if you</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>are under 18, pregnant or breastfeeding;</li>
        <li>
          have diabetes, kidney, liver, heart or thyroid disease, or take medication that affects
          appetite, weight or fluid balance;
        </li>
        <li>
          have a history of disordered eating, or notice the numbers becoming a source of anxiety;
        </li>
        <li>
          plan to eat below 1,200 kcal (women) or 1,500 kcal (men) per day, or to lose more than 1%
          of your body weight per week.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        All formulas carry an error of roughly ±10% for an individual. Results should be treated as
        a starting point to be adjusted against real-world progress, ideally with the support of a
        registered dietitian or doctor. We make no warranty as to accuracy, completeness or fitness
        for a particular purpose.
      </p>
      <h2>Emergencies</h2>
      <p>
        If you feel unwell, faint, or experience symptoms you are concerned about, stop dieting and
        seek medical care.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
